# Services

## Onde colocar

| Tipo | Pasta | Exemplo |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Dominio / API / models | `domains/` | `UserService`, `OrderApi` |
| Infra transversal | `core/` | interceptors helpers, auth session |
| Util sem dominio | `shared/` | formatters puros (se fizer sentido como service) |

## Padroes

- `providedIn: "root"` para singletons da app, salvo escopo explicito de feature/route.
- Preferir `inject()` para dependencias.
- Expor estado com **signals** quando for estado da app; usar Observables para streams HTTP/eventos e converter na borda (`toSignal`).
- Services de dominio **nao** importam componentes nem features.

## Exemplo

```ts
import { Injectable, inject, signal } from "@angular/core";
import { HttpClient } from "@angular/common/http";

@Injectable({ providedIn: "root" })
export class ExampleService {
  private readonly http = inject(HttpClient);
  readonly loading = signal(false);
}
```
